00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:36,000
Dogs (Spanish: Perros) is a 2025 black comedy film written and
directed by Gerardo Minutti in his directorial debut.

7
00:56:35,000 --> 00:56:41,000
It stars Néstor Guzzini, Marcelo Subiotto and María Elena Pérez.

8
