A co-production between Uruguay and Argentina, the film had its world premiere at the 28th Málaga Film Festival on March 18, 2025, where it competed for
the Golden Biznaga for Best Latin-American Film and María Elena Pérez was honored with the Silver Biznaga for Best Supporting Actress.

10
